From 56991db55a64a87ecc7731c5c3434550e47ff1fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hyperdrive Project <noreply@hyperdrive-project.invalid>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:50:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] scheduler: choose the short-tail mode per request in the
 policy (keeps the system-prompt checkpoint)

Admission-time boundary dropping removed message checkpoints such as the system prompt when a user
turn was short. RequestSpec/LiveRequest now carry stable_history and prefill_work applies keep-last
only to unstable (reasoning) prompts. 952 Helios lib tests pass.

